---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import HeroGradient from '../components/HeroGradient.astro';
import Instagram from '../components/Instagram.astro';
import ShinyButton from '../components/ui/shiny-button';
---
<Base lang="en" page="web" title="Web Design — LOGYC STUDIO" description="Professional websites for your business: Landing package $1,500,000 and Professional $2,500,000 COP. Domain, responsive design, local SEO, and WhatsApp included.">
<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero page-hero has-gradient" id="top">
  <HeroGradient />
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="bk">[</span> WEB DESIGN <span class="bk">]</span></span></div>
    <h1>
      <span class="reveal-line"><span style="animation-delay:.35s">A website that lives up</span></span>
      <span class="reveal-line"><span class="lime" style="animation-delay:.5s">to your work.</span></span>
    </h1>
    <p class="sub">We design professional websites that showcase what you do and turn every visit into a quote request. Two clear packages, fixed prices, and delivery in days.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a href="#paquetes" class="btn btn-primary">View packages <span class="arw">→</span></a>
      <a href="#incluye" class="btn btn-ghost">What's included</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-hint"><span>Scroll</span><span class="bar"></span></div>
</section>

<!-- 01 DIAGNÓSTICO -->
<section class="block" id="diagnostico">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head fx"><span class="sec-num">[ 01 ]</span><span class="eyebrow"><span class="bk">/</span> DIAGNOSIS</span></div>
    <h2 class="sec-title fx">If your business lives on Instagram,<br><span class="lime">you're missing clients.</span></h2>
    <p class="lead fx">Your work speaks for itself, but if everything depends on social media, only people who already follow you can find you. Here's what we see in most businesses:</p>
    <div class="why-grid pain-grid fx">
      <div class="why-cell"><div class="sym">01</div><h4>No website of your own</h4><p>Your business lives on Instagram and a WhatsApp link. You're missing your own web address that conveys the credibility of an established company.</p></div>
      <div class="why-cell"><div class="sym">02</div><h4>Only people who know you can find you</h4><p>Google shows you to people searching for your name. The challenge is showing up for people looking for your service who don't know you yet.</p></div>
      <div class="why-cell"><div class="sym">03</div><h4>You depend on an algorithm</h4><p>Instagram decides who sees your posts. One platform change or a blocked account, and you lose your main source of clients.</p></div>
      <div class="why-cell"><div class="sym">04</div><h4>Your work is hard to find</h4><p>Your best projects are buried among hundreds of posts. A new client can't see at a glance everything you can do.</p></div>
      <div class="why-cell"><div class="sym">05</div><h4>Your best proof is hidden</h4><p>Your Google reviews build trust, but people who find you on Instagram never see them.</p></div>
      <div class="why-cell"><div class="sym">06</div><h4>Your services aren't explained</h4><p>There's no place that explains what you do. Clients have to message you just to ask the basics.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="note fx"><b>[ fact ]</b> Clients decide in the first 5 seconds. A presence that matches your service turns visits into decisions.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 02 QUÉ INCLUYE -->
<section class="svc" id="incluye">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head fx"><span class="sec-num">[ 02 ]</span><span class="eyebrow"><span class="bk">/</span> WHAT'S INCLUDED</span></div>
    <h2 class="sec-title fx">Everything your site needs,<br><span class="lime">no tech jargon.</span></h2>
    <div class="incl-grid">
      <div class="fx">
        <div class="mlabel">[ THE WEBSITE ]</div>
        <ul class="feat"><li>Your own web address (custom domain), e.g. www.yourbusiness.com</li><li>Design that adapts perfectly to phone, tablet, and desktop (responsive design)</li><li>A single page (Landing) or 5 to 7 pages with an interactive home page (Professional)</li><li>Basic local SEO setup, so over time Google shows your site in searches in your area</li><li>Direct button to message you on WhatsApp or request a quote</li><li>Gallery of your work, organized by service</li></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="fx">
        <div class="mlabel">[ PAGES INCLUDED ]</div>
        <div class="pg-list"><div class="pg-item"><b>Home</b><span>Introduction, featured work, and WhatsApp button. On the Professional plan, it's an interactive home page.</span></div><div class="pg-item"><b>Services</b><span>Each of your services explained, so clients don't have to ask the basics.</span></div><div class="pg-item"><b>About</b><span>Your business, your team, and your experience, told in a way that builds trust.</span></div><div class="pg-item"><b>Gallery</b><span>Your work, organized by service.</span></div><div class="pg-item"><b>Contact</b><span>Location, hours, WhatsApp, and map.</span></div></div>
        <p class="pg-note">On the Landing plan, these sections are combined into a single page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 03 PORTAFOLIO -->
<section class="svc work" id="portafolio">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head fx"><span class="sec-num">[ 03 ]</span><span class="eyebrow"><span class="bk">/</span> PORTFOLIO</span></div>
    <h2 class="sec-title fx">Real projects,<br><span class="lime">live and working.</span></h2>
    <p class="lead fx">This is what a LOGYC website looks like in the real world. Explore it right here or visit it live.</p>
    <div class="case">
      <div class="fx">
        <div class="case-stage">
          <div class="browser">
            <div class="browser-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="browser-url">https://<b>precisiongarage.com.co</b></span></div>
            <div class="browser-screen autoscroll" data-speed="70" tabindex="0" aria-label="Desktop view of the Precision Garage website">
              <img src="/img/portfolio/precision-garage-desktop.jpg" width="1100" height="6316" loading="lazy" alt="Desktop view of the Precision Garage website">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="phone">
            <div class="phone-screen autoscroll" data-speed="45" tabindex="0" aria-label="Mobile view of the Precision Garage website">
              <img src="/img/portfolio/precision-garage-mobile.jpg" width="600" height="7200" loading="lazy" alt="Mobile view of the Precision Garage website">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-hint"><span class="dot"></span>Scroll inside the screen to explore the site</div>
      </div>
      <div class="case-info fx">
        <div class="mlabel">Web design · Bogotá</div>
        <h3>Precision Garage</h3>
        <p class="d">A Mercedes-Benz specialist shop in north Bogotá, with technicians trained by Daimler Colombia. We designed their complete website to showcase their expertise, explain every service, and turn visits into WhatsApp bookings.</p>
        <div class="chips"><span>8-page website</span><span>Interactive home</span><span>Responsive</span><span>Local SEO</span><span>Custom copy</span></div>
        <ul class="feat"><li>Interactive home page with scroll animations</li><li>A dedicated page per service: maintenance, diagnostics, and express service</li><li>Direct WhatsApp booking with a ready-to-send message</li><li>Google reviews (5.0 ★) and a work gallery to build trust</li><li>Local SEO with structured data to show up on Google</li></ul>
        <div class="case-actions">
          <a href="https://precisiongarage.com.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">View live site <span class="arw">↗</span></a>
          <a href="#paquetes" class="btn btn-ghost">View packages</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<!-- 04 PAQUETES -->
<section class="svc" id="paquetes">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head fx"><span class="sec-num">[ 04 ]</span><span class="eyebrow"><span class="bk">/</span> PACKAGES</span></div>
    <h2 class="sec-title fx">Two packages.<br><span class="lime">Clear pricing.</span></h2>
    <div class="pkgs two">
      <div class="pkg fx">
        <div class="pk-name">Landing</div>
        <div class="pk-tag">Fast, modern presence.</div>
        <div class="pk-desc">Ideal to get started: your whole business on a single page.</div>
        <div class="pk-amount">$1,500,000 <small>COP</small></div>
        <div class="pk-time">Delivered in 3 to 5 business days</div>
        <ul class="plist"><li>A single page with every section: home, services, gallery, and contact</li><li>Your own domain (web address) for 1 year</li><li>Design that looks great on phone and desktop</li><li>3 to 5 AI-generated photos of your business</li><li>Direct WhatsApp button and map</li><li>Basic setup so Google can find your site</li><li>1 round of revisions</li></ul>
        <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-ghost">I want this plan</a>
      </div>
      <div class="pkg feat-pkg fx">
        <span class="pop">Recommended</span>
        <div class="pk-name">Professional</div>
        <div class="pk-tag">A complete site that brings you new clients.</div>
        <div class="pk-desc">For businesses that want to grow and show up on Google.</div>
        <div class="pk-amount">$2,500,000 <small>COP</small></div>
        <div class="pk-time">Delivered in 7 to 10 business days</div>
        <ul class="plist"><li>Everything in Landing, in a complete 5 to 7 page site</li><li>Interactive home page: a hero with animations and effects that react to scrolling and the mouse</li><li>A dedicated page for each service</li><li>Google Maps profile optimized for searches like “[your service] near me”</li><li>Your Google reviews and a full gallery of your work</li><li>Quote form: client details and photos go straight to your WhatsApp</li><li>7 to 10 AI-generated photos of your business</li><li>We write all the copy for your site</li><li>See how many people visit your site and message you</li><li>Brand guide: your official colors and fonts</li><li>1 month of maintenance included</li><li>2 rounds of revisions</li></ul>
        <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-primary">I want this plan <span class="arw">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="note fx"><b>[ note ]</b> Prices in Colombian pesos (COP). The first year of your domain is included; renewal from year two is $79,999/year, paid by the client.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 04 COMPARATIVA -->
<section class="svc" id="comparativa">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head fx"><span class="sec-num">[ 05 ]</span><span class="eyebrow"><span class="bk">/</span> COMPARISON</span></div>
    <h2 class="sec-title fx">What each one <span class="lime">includes.</span></h2>
    <div class="cmp-wrap fx"><table class="cmp">
      <thead><tr><th>Includes</th><th>Landing</th><th class="hl">Professional</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      <tr><td>Pages</td><td>1 (single page)</td><td class="hl">5–7</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Interactive home page (animations & effects)</td><td class="no">—</td><td class="yes hl">✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>A page for each service</td><td class="no">—</td><td class="yes hl">✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Custom domain for 1 year</td><td class="yes">✓</td><td class="yes hl">✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Phone & desktop design</td><td class="yes">✓</td><td class="yes hl">✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Direct WhatsApp button</td><td class="yes">✓</td><td class="yes hl">✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>AI-generated photos</td><td>3–5</td><td class="hl">7–10</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Copy written by LOGYC</td><td>AI-assisted base</td><td class="yes hl">✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Google reviews on the site</td><td class="no">—</td><td class="yes hl">✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Google visibility</td><td>Basic</td><td class="hl">Advanced</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Optimized Google Maps profile</td><td class="no">—</td><td class="yes hl">✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>WhatsApp quote form</td><td class="no">—</td><td class="yes hl">✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Visit & WhatsApp click tracking</td><td class="no">—</td><td class="yes hl">✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Brand guide (colors & fonts)</td><td class="no">—</td><td class="yes hl">✓</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Maintenance included</td><td class="no">—</td><td class="hl">1 month</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Revision rounds</td><td>1</td><td class="hl">2</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Delivery</td><td>3–5 business days</td><td class="hl">7–10 business days</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Investment</td><td>$1,500,000</td><td class="hl">$2,500,000</td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 05 MANTENIMIENTO -->
<section class="svc" id="mantenimiento">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head fx"><span class="sec-num">[ 06 ]</span><span class="eyebrow"><span class="bk">/</span> MAINTENANCE</span></div>
    <h2 class="sec-title fx">Your site always up to date,<br><span class="lime">without the technical hassle.</span></h2>
    <p class="lead fx">An optional monthly plan to keep your site updated and running.</p>
    <div class="maint">
      <div class="maint-card fx">
        <div class="mlabel">Monthly fee</div>
        <div class="big">$150,000 <small>/month</small></div>
        <p>Optional for both plans. The first month is included in the Professional plan.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="maint-lists">
        <div class="maint-box fx"><div class="mlabel">[ INCLUDES ]</div><ul class="plist"><li>Up to 4 content changes per month: copy, prices, hours, or promotions</li><li>Up to 6 new photos of your work in the gallery</li><li>Monthly check that your site, WhatsApp, and form are working</li><li>Monthly report of visits and WhatsApp clicks</li><li>WhatsApp support, with replies within 2 business days</li></ul></div>
        <div class="maint-box fx"><div class="mlabel">[ NOT INCLUDED · QUOTED SEPARATELY ]</div><ul class="plist minus"><li>New pages or sections</li><li>Site redesign</li><li>New AI-generated photos or content</li><li>Google or social media ads</li><li>Annual domain renewal</li></ul></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 06 FORMA DE PAGO -->
<section class="svc" id="pago">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head fx"><span class="sec-num">[ 07 ]</span><span class="eyebrow"><span class="bk">/</span> PAYMENT</span></div>
    <h2 class="sec-title fx">Pay in two parts,<br><span class="lime">no surprises.</span></h2>
    <p class="lead fx">The project fee is split into two equal payments.</p>
    <div class="pay">
      <div class="pay-card fx"><div class="mlabel">Payment 01</div><div class="big">50%</div><p>Before the project starts</p><div class="pay-row"><span>Landing plan</span><b>$750,000</b></div><div class="pay-row"><span>Professional plan</span><b>$1,250,000</b></div></div>
      <div class="pay-card fx"><div class="mlabel">Payment 02</div><div class="big">50%</div><p>Upon delivery</p><div class="pay-row"><span>Landing plan</span><b>$750,000</b></div><div class="pay-row"><span>Professional plan</span><b>$1,250,000</b></div></div>
      <div class="pay-card fx"><div class="mlabel">Payment method</div><div class="big txt">Bank transfer</div><p>We'll share the account details once you confirm your package.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 07 CÓMO EMPEZAMOS -->
<section class="block proc" id="proceso">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head fx"><span class="sec-num">[ 08 ]</span><span class="eyebrow"><span class="bk">/</span> HOW WE START</span></div>
    <h2 class="sec-title fx">In a few days you'll have<br><span class="lime">your new site.</span></h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="tl fx"><div class="tl-n">01</div><div class="tl-c"><h4>We choose your package</h4><p>Together we define what your business needs and fine-tune any details.</p></div></div>
      <div class="tl fx"><div class="tl-n">02</div><div class="tl-c"><h4>We gather your materials</h4><p>You share your logo, photos of your work, and business details. Together we choose your web address (domain).</p></div></div>
      <div class="tl fx"><div class="tl-n">03</div><div class="tl-c"><h4>We deliver it live</h4><p>We show you the site running online so you can review it. Includes revision rounds before final delivery (1 on Landing, 2 on Professional).</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="block faq" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head fx"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="bk">[</span> FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS <span class="bk">]</span></span></div>
    <h2 class="sec-title fx">What everyone <span class="lime">asks.</span></h2>
    <div class="acc" id="acc">
      <div class="acc-item"><button class="acc-q">Is the domain included? <span class="ico">+</span></button><div class="acc-a"><p>Yes. The first year of your domain (e.g. www.yourbusiness.com) is included in both plans. From year two, renewal is $79,999/year and is paid by the client.</p></div></div>
      <div class="acc-item"><button class="acc-q">How long will my site take? <span class="ico">+</span></button><div class="acc-a"><p>The Landing plan is delivered in 3 to 5 business days and the Professional plan in 7 to 10 business days.</p></div></div>
      <div class="acc-item"><button class="acc-q">What do I need to have ready? <span class="ico">+</span></button><div class="acc-a"><p>Your logo, photos of your work, and your business details (services, location, hours). Both plans also include AI-generated photos of your business.</p></div></div>
      <div class="acc-item"><button class="acc-q">Who writes the copy? <span class="ico">+</span></button><div class="acc-a"><p>On the Professional plan, we write all the copy for your site. On the Landing plan, we prepare an AI-assisted base from the information you share with us.</p></div></div>
      <div class="acc-item"><button class="acc-q">What happens after delivery? <span class="ico">+</span></button><div class="acc-a"><p>Your site is live online. If you'd like us to keep it up to date, there's the maintenance plan for $150,000/month (the first month is included with Professional).</p></div></div>
      <div class="acc-item"><button class="acc-q">Can I request changes? <span class="ico">+</span></button><div class="acc-a"><p>Yes. The Landing plan includes 1 round of revisions and the Professional plan includes 2, before final delivery.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta" id="contacto">
  <div class="cta-glow"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow fx" style="margin-bottom:26px;display:inline-flex"><span class="bk">[</span> LET'S START <span class="bk">]</span></span>
    <h2 class="fx">Ready for a website<br>of your <span class="lime">own?</span></h2>
    <p class="fx">Tell us about your business and we'll help you choose the right package.</p>
    <div class="cta-row fx">
      <ShinyButton href="contacto-en.html" label="Start now →" />
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-ghost">Message us on WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
    <Instagram lang="en" variant="cta" />
  </div>
</section>
</Base>
